{"id":"ee8677f552ac477b","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-ck.md","title":"Church–Kleene 序数","display":"df-ck — Church–Kleene 序数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-ck","aliases":["20-df-ck"],"display":"df-ck — Church–Kleene 序数","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"既有条目的集合论定义修复；书外补充","depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-wellorder]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-ck"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-ck</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ck — Church–Kleene 序数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"既有条目的集合论定义修复；书外补充"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1425fc4773bfa69c\" href=\"?note=1425fc4773bfa69c\" title=\"20-df-computable-wellorder\">20-df-computable-wellorder</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecOrd}=\\{\\operatorname{otp}(D,R):\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{RecOrd}=\\{\\operatorname{otp}(D,R):\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1425fc4773bfa69c\" href=\"?note=1425fc4773bfa69c\" title=\"20-df-computable-wellorder\">20-df-computable-wellorder</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\">\\(\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\)</span> 是可计算良序型的上确界，见 ck；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CK}\">\\(\\mathrm{CK}\\)</span> 是名称下标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ck}\\vdash\n\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}:=\\sup\\operatorname{RecOrd}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ck}\\vdash\n\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}:=\\sup\\operatorname{RecOrd}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可计算良序只有可数多个，故该上确界是可数序数。可计算良序能有效接一个末端点，因此没有最大可计算序型。等于最小非可计算序数的标准论证还使用可计算序型向下闭合；本原子不再把未定义 RecOrd、Wor 塞进断言。原称“第 14 章来源”错误，已移入补充区。</p>\n<p>来源：既有条目的集合论定义修复；书外补充。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-wellorder","status":"resolved","id":"1425fc4773bfa69c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-wellorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-wellorder","status":"resolved","id":"1425fc4773bfa69c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-wellorder]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{RecOrd}=\\{\\operatorname{otp}(D,R):\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CK}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ck}\\vdash\n\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}:=\\sup\\operatorname{RecOrd}.","display":true}],"bytes":1263,"backlinks":[{"id":"a6caa184e5759034","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ck]]；see [[20-df-computable-wellorder]]；see [[20-df-anal]]。"}],"outgoing":["1425fc4773bfa69c"]}